## Field reference

| attribute | constraints |
|---|---|
| `user_id` | Required. ID of the user. Changing forces replacement. |
| `role_id` | Required. ID of the role to assign. Changing forces replacement. |
| `role_name` | Read-only. Name of the assigned role. |

`(user_id, role_id)` is unique. Role assignments are managed exclusively through
this resource; the `mistershell_user` resource and data source expose assigned
roles read-only via their `roles` attribute.

